      "phrases": ["What do you do?", "They help by...", "I want to be...", "Their job is to...", "Where do they work?"],
      "grammar": ["Present simple for jobs", "Want to/Going to", "Wh-questions about jobs", "Simple past tense"],
      "exercises": [
